                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0ea42e40-a6a7-43fe-b2c4-2eddb6025d2b",
                                "sense_id": "1482a11f-4f87-3439-9ac6-5c93ded65e0c",
                                "text": "W grze Rage 2 stale toczysz walki ze swoimi przeciwnikami, aby uchronić się od śmierci musisz kontrolować życie swojego bohatera. Na tej stornie poradnika do gry Rage 2 dowiesz się jak kontrolować zdrowie swojego bohatera, jak go wyleczyć oraz jak zdobywać substancje lecznicze.",
                                "translation": "In the game Rage 2 you are constantly fighting with your opponents, in order to save yourself from death you need to control the life of your hero. On this page of the Rage 2 game guide you will learn how to control the health of your hero, how to heal him and how to get healing substances.",
                                "english": "In the game Rage 2 you are constantly fighting with your opponents, in order to save yourself from death you need to control the life of your hero. On this page of the Rage 2 game guide you will learn how to control the health of your hero, how to heal him and how to get healing substances."
                            }
